/* =============================================================================
 * sec-inventory.css — #inventory (the [AT] COVERFLOW) retuned to the viewport
 * -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * Loaded AFTER structural.css, so equal specificity wins on order. Every
 * selector below therefore MATCHES the [AT] selector that owns the property
 * ((1,2,0) for the track, (1,3,0) for the card parts); nothing here relies on
 * a lower-specificity rule quietly working.
