#inventory.collection .collection__grid { margin-top: 0; }
#inventory.collection .cov-nav { margin-top: 0; }


/* -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * 7. ONE CONTROL ROW INSTEAD OF TWO STACKED ONES
 * -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * The band ended in three separate full-width rows: the track, then the
 * prev/next/counter nav, then the two page CTAs — 44 + 16 + 24 + 51 = 135px of
 * furniture under the cards. The nav is ~150px wide and the CTA pair ~470px, so
