/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   PART 1 — THE MAP PLACEHOLDER  (problem (b): the hollow panel)

   It becomes "a stylised night map with a frosted address card sitting on it"
   instead of "a centred island in a black rectangle". Structurally:

       .cta-map__placeholder   grid, place-items:STRETCH (was center)
