}

/* ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3. .cta-banner__media — the author fixed HALF of this leak

   Worth reading as a cautionary case, because the hazard was KNOWN here: the
   comment at :3907 says "Placed after [U.1]; the mobile override is re-asserted
   so it is not lost to source order". It re-asserts `.cta-banner`'s margin-top
   at :3913 — and misses `min-height` on the sibling.
       :3859  @media (max-width:860px) .cta-banner__media { min-height: 190px }
       :3905  UNSCOPED                 .cta-banner__media { min-height: 200px }  <- wins
       :3913  @media (max-width:860px) .cta-banner { margin-top: -58px }  (rescued)
   Re-asserting the mobile min-height in the same arm the author already built.
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
