/* ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4. #industries tile deks sit BELOW the design system's own floor

   :4215 sets the dek to `clamp(13px, 0.95vw, 14.5px)` — a 13px floor. :7583
   then declares 12.5px UNSCOPED, as part of [AR]'s 1440 four-up cell tuning,
