/* ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   7. [BM cont.] the qualifier form needs scroll room past the sticky bar

   Companion to the site.js [BM] scroll fix. The wizard's Continue button can
   sit inside the fixed CTA bar's band (measured at 375: step 2's button at
   y 788-830 against a bar at 774-844, elementFromPoint returning the BAR).
   Scrolling alone cannot always clear it — at the document end there may be no
